      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    stock_price = 52\n    volatility = 0.12\n    trading_days = 252\n    z_score = 2.326\n\n    deep_in_the_money_calls = 5000\n    deep_out_of_the_money_calls = 20000\n    futures = 10000\n\n    # Deep ITM call delta is approximately 1; deep OTM call delta is approximately 0.\n    deep_in_the_money_call_delta = 1\n    deep_out_of_the_money_call_delta = 0\n    futures_delta = 1\n\n    # Calculate the portfolio's combined delta\n    combined_delta = (\n        deep_in_the_money_calls * deep_in_the_money_call_delta\n        + deep_out_of_the_money_calls * deep_out_of_the_money_call_delta\n        + futures * futures_delta\n    )\n\n    # Calculate the 1-day price volatility of XYZ\n    daily_price_volatility = stock_price * volatility / (trading_days ** 0.5)\n\n    # Calculate the 1-day 99% VaR\n    var = z_score * combined_delta * daily_price_volatility\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(var, 3)\n```",
